      47.85,
      369.61,
      540.05,
      428.68
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 66(2) of the Inland Revenue Act, No. 24 of 2017 in relation tospecific provision for a debt claim made by a person conducting a banking business, I, Disanayake Mudiyanselage LalithIvan Disanayake, Commissioner General of Inland Revenue, do by this notice specify the specific provision for a debtclaim in accordance with the relevant directives made by the Central Bank of Sri Lanka subject to conditions as set out inthe Schedule.",
